# l1d27: D27 goal-level witnesses for lookaround L1 (spec-first, blinded author).
# Every expectation below is libpcre2-8 10.46 (ctypes), never pcrec. The listing
# half of each witness (req_whole_run value / dead) is not expressible in .rxt and
# lives in l1d27_listing.tsv beside this file, keyed by the WITNESS id comment.
# description D27 lookaround L1 witnesses: lookaround bytes joining the run, contradicted lookarounds (dead), look-alike controls
# oracle pcre2/10.46

# WITNESS A01 kind=A
pattern (?=kev)...
